[agent] This is a feature group ingestion task. The crux is "latest revision per `row_id`" — Hopsworks resolves this via the `event_time` column as the Hudi/Delta precombine key (max event-time wins per primary key on upsert). Let me build a single combined CSV so one merge resolves all duplicates, then verify on-platform.
[agent] Let me first inspect duplicates and build the combined file.
